      "text": "[bright] Big webs, man. I want to see what made them. From here.",
      "characters": 64,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "m2SNxEksHjl3i71Y5Jsh",
      "chargedCharacters": "28"
    },
    {
      "id": "vess__q8_exp_gap_vess_1",
      "voiceId": "5OtKrUz8y0NUBuMW6YcK",
      "text": "[delighted] Look at those gates. Somebody paid plenty to feel safe.",
      "characters": 67,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "udB4j4UTl4ONcDT3tzfs",
      "chargedCharacters": "29"
    },
    {
      "id": "vess__q9_exp_gap_vess_1",
      "voiceId": "5OtKrUz8y0NUBuMW6YcK",
      "text": "[soft] Fancy place, man. Keep an eye on the stairs while we talk.",
      "characters": 65,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "K2E07N6ZyxYOfKOciGUK",
      "chargedCharacters": "29"
    },
    {
      "id": "vess__q11_exp_gap_vess_1",
      "voiceId": "5OtKrUz8y0NUBuMW6YcK",
      "text": "[amused] That picture does you no favours, man. Nearly walked past it.",
      "characters": 70,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "HuqIygyANKWhLwCBVnyK",
      "chargedCharacters": "31"
    },
    {
      "id": "vess__q12_exp_gap_vess_1",
      "voiceId": "5OtKrUz8y0NUBuMW6YcK",
      "text": "[hushed, delighted] All these fine clothes. I'll try not to singe yours.",
      "characters": 72,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "jPcSN1xaQ60d33d7Yoph",
      "chargedCharacters": "32"
    },
    {
      "id": "vess__q13_exp_gap_vess_1",
      "voiceId": "5OtKrUz8y0NUBuMW6YcK",
      "text": "[sing-song] Down we go. Keep a little light for me, man.",
      "characters": 56,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "WOw0elpfQOqS1jY9oF3Z",
      "chargedCharacters": "25"
    },
    {
      "id": "vess__q14_exp_gap_vess_1",
      "voiceId": "5OtKrUz8y0NUBuMW6YcK",
      "text": "[quiet] No laughing now. I want to hear what he says.",
      "characters": 53,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "hywZ8QUHTIIOtBUCWzN3",
      "chargedCharacters": "23"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q6_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[flat] Watch where you step, man. I don't want to cut you out of a web.",
      "characters": 71,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "IwFebx9g9O8ltW50WUch",
      "chargedCharacters": "31"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q9_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[low] Let them talk, man. We came for the records.",
      "characters": 50,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "tVqiM6mkRRCkJn4VXF5M",
      "chargedCharacters": "22"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q10_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[low] Let the keepers see the seals before anyone touches the papers.",
      "characters": 69,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "jBiFo0y7UsnmR3XYNJ2W",
      "chargedCharacters": "30"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q11_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[flat] Don't look at the posters. People watch whoever stops to read them.",
      "characters": 74,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "VqGrMdNXj5FrsnY0Ydia",
      "chargedCharacters": "33"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q12_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[low] Keep the papers in reach, man. No fumbling when they call on you.",
      "characters": 71,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "HhOPfNTsESTnRky2FrgR",
      "chargedCharacters": "31"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q13_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[flat] One at a time on the narrow steps. Keep your blade clear.",
      "characters": 64,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "hI0BAonY7ERdtKK7Onlg",
      "chargedCharacters": "28"
    },
    {
      "id": "fennick__q14_exp_gap_fennick_1",
      "voiceId": "R7jdv6H5bZOU3sQIMhbd",
      "text": "[low] Watch his hands, man. I will watch the way behind us.",
      "characters": 59,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "aeT1I5ZJfNxnZHbnKC0D",
      "chargedCharacters": "26"
    },
    {
      "id": "nettle__q9_exp_gap_nettle_1",
      "voiceId": "U1NXjHF5ene7Eze10d5J",
      "text": "[low] Let me see the men who signed those orders. I want them to hear what happened downstream.",
      "characters": 95,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "TFEiC4AYqiFbnWyyQ7wU",
      "chargedCharacters": "42"
    },
    {
      "id": "nettle__q10_exp_gap_nettle_1",
      "voiceId": "U1NXjHF5ene7Eze10d5J",
      "text": "[wary] These keepers had better read what we brought. I did not come here to be waved away.",
      "characters": 91,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Ky6RReRzWeflQBJzCq9H",
      "chargedCharacters": "40"
    },
    {
      "id": "nettle__q11_exp_gap_nettle_1",
      "voiceId": "U1NXjHF5ene7Eze10d5J",
      "text": "[fierce] They call you the criminal. Eh? After what their mine did?",
      "characters": 67,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "7TUANTWIQ640sUq5y229",
      "chargedCharacters": "29"
    },
    {
      "id": "nettle__q12_exp_gap_nettle_1",
      "voiceId": "U1NXjHF5ene7Eze10d5J",
      "text": "[low] Let them hear the names from the mine. Loud enough for the back of the hall.",
      "characters": 82,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "CTe7xkikKA3WBZvKAkJD",
      "chargedCharacters": "36"
    },
    {
      "id": "nettle__q13_exp_gap_nettle_1",
      "voiceId": "U1NXjHF5ene7Eze10d5J",
      "text": "[quiet] No roots this far down. Keep close. I do not like it here.",
      "characters": 66,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "oK6QAeDVYsthZwXCy96n",
      "chargedCharacters": "29"
    },
    {
      "id": "nettle__q14_exp_gap_nettle_1",
      "voiceId": "U1NXjHF5ene7Eze10d5J",
      "text": "[hard] He wants a sacrifice. He can come and try to take one.",
      "characters": 61,
      "state": "saved",
