      "chargedCharacters": "27"
    },
    {
      "id": "durnik__q10_exp_gap_durnik_1",
      "voiceId": "QZU5JP2C26gx328DNBza",
      "text": "[gravelly] Keep those papers dry, bach. We brought them a long way.",
      "characters": 67,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "NhitRvInMQf4ZfMV10FJ",
      "chargedCharacters": "29"
    },
    {
      "id": "durnik__q11_exp_gap_durnik_1",
      "voiceId": "QZU5JP2C26gx328DNBza",
      "text": "[grim] A wanted notice. Aye. Easier than answering what's in the ledgers.",
      "characters": 73,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Atu3AbTp1rAOmRE7EB8l",
      "chargedCharacters": "32"
    },
    {
      "id": "durnik__q12_exp_gap_durnik_1",
      "voiceId": "QZU5JP2C26gx328DNBza",
      "text": "[quiet] Let them read the names. No one talks over that. Not while I am here.",
      "characters": 77,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "Zv6ZsBUTej13ZvrLRkFJ",
      "chargedCharacters": "34"
    },
    {
      "id": "durnik__q14_exp_gap_durnik_1",
      "voiceId": "QZU5JP2C26gx328DNBza",
      "text": "[low] Deep places should be quiet. Listen to this one. Keep your shield up, bach.",
      "characters": 81,
      "state": "saved",
      "requestId": "cAKfLq5cLbNqcEx0woFg",
      "chargedCharacters": "36"
    },
    {
      "id": "dorran__q8_exp_gap_dorran_1",
      "voiceId": "7ma36jg9JC0d1pfrWXMw",
      "text": "[quiet] G-good to be above ground. Give me a moment before we cross.",
